      "value": "@{5f4ba617a657d93390b5364b|full_name} What my contry as anything to do with this and i dont really have community im only moderator in few groups. World creator always had moderation power as stated in blog and you not even notice that fact as no one abuse power in publics. Public are usally made by random people that in most cases just leave later on and instance is a alive for long time after and it still wild wild west.\n\nI assume you not in favor of abusing power so i also assume you trusting yourself that you not gonna abuse it, so make your own instance, that simple, or else you not really belive in your values\n\nAnd again since introduction of group publics, group use them insted as they more reliable, they dont care about other publics in most cases or else they run the world, then they ALWAYS had moderation power on uploader account, making no diffidence",
