      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ae4f9f6801fa451b10edafc|full_name} World creator doesn't abuse power because he is only one.  The world creator can only be at one place at a time! Saying there is no power abuse in public instances is not a valid statistic, this should be obvious.\n\nWhich isn't the same situation when everyone become able to make their instances public. This is the same thing as group instances, but won't have the paywall of VRC+ anymore.\n\nAlso, again: please stop generalizing!! As I already said, it's not always easy to fill a instance! You should consider less populated countries, so making a instance myself is not going to solve the issue since nobody will join it. You should also not assume every instance creator is Visitor who is going to leave the game in minutes.\n\nThe main problem this changes brings is the end of VRC+ Paywall that used to prevent most people of abusing power. Anyone will be able to ru(i)n a public instance.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
