      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Removing the VRC+ paywall to moderate public instances is like removing the lock from a door. Most people were never going to rob you, but the lock kept out the lazy ones, and without it, you know what is going to happen. This applies to power abuse.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
